  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:711cebd1c1018289501b18a0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刚到东京的时候，\r\n在危险的时候帮助我的人\r\n是训练员真是太好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a39d1a27ece3274ca63c4614e54b8f39d019b1b2056401bd981e767c67a3f90",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:16174c999fa5bfa8285df48f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就算是城里的校服，\r\n现在的我也穿习惯了……！……吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "914dd28d76f8db9703f5ecb36b296246651be3e621ff656e144d0d5d2c0124a5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c364aaf0a1338d458e76e213",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就像偶像一样……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "06616017d9ebdb79692b8b86137621ab87a704d4d79968502c154deb740da942",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79c71dc952e281270044f2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "直到成为“城市女孩”为止，\r\n我都会一直跑下去！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1a0fe109c887c6ce195ee294c9d639d0f4a7cd522e072d6ba0548f4d503e811",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6059d6d2c84f5c42f97e0b69",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要看着这个颜色……\r\n就会回想起在老家盛开的堇花呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7148130d3e4788388926aca3816ed5a48a6696bf8ba90e4d8e76523f96380cf9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:205255336f23d80caedeaac2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔会忘记系好脚上的带子呢……\r\n真让人害羞啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "15a36b470a8e16e0019df34bfab554924b129a8584f0cc2ad0fe3f9ca2bf2f9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2ea746438795f3639e14374",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这套衣服可是加入了很多雪国的元素哦……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5485d5b9a71c69e71afb1618723e4208a20c38a755dc72e991827df3cc97b70f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70fce917d4f59cabb8638b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "あやぁ～たまげた。大変身だぁ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "364938bb275f0c51628bae57d889572136faf49e035654506583f958ffaf998a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5f511f20b9d547a2c52c3e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "和洋折衷…オシャレだなはん！",
      "source_fingerprint": "434c5f234fbffedefc9d708b77690b01c5f5f7d052268558f71e6c5082407369",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8904dd9d9e62bdf4341412fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身也好可爱啊～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ff6bf11842663da3571a4123c018837f83384ceb650d3421e8909bea0c30c8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59461e44cb96b16841362ccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "需要换衣服什么的……\r\n就像是模特一样～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8eb20dafa0a5bdb6f7c5086dacafae8b1146c94614bbf639fe509d0f398f57e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87fffddb9e9fdb079af937dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "変じゃない、ですよねぇ…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "66260018d3c1a3c6fce51594bcf4f28d3f74f7d6290c51fda8a8b63691a320fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:061b2f2ca1ec6e2a3eac9ffb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ちょこっと、ですけど…\r\nヒール…ですっ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87a371b9aaadf740815ee8bfe9497071b42e5addf95075be365b03b888176a43",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1029",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9343cee5c51c8c3890924e4d",
